    "en": {
      "name": "Domain of the Dark Ruler",
      "effect": "If you control no monsters, you can activate this card the turn it was Set. When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card and you have a Level 7 or higher DARK monster with 2500 DEF in your field or GY: Negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card, then if this card was activated during your turn, you can apply this effect.\n\u25cf Neither player can activate Spell/Trap Cards for the rest of this turn.\nYou can only activate 1 \"Domain of the Dark Ruler\" per turn.",
